# Hyper-V guest support, built in rather than modular, for Azure guests.
#
# ONLY the symbols that are actually wanted. The dependencies that cap them at
# =m in a given Photon config (CONNECTOR, VSOCKETS, SCSI_FC_ATTRS on the 5.0
# generic configs) are NOT listed here on purpose: which ones need raising is a
# property of the config being patched and of the kernel's own Kconfig, so it is
# COMPUTED by kconfig::dependency_closure and reported, never assumed. A
# hard-coded list silently does the wrong thing on the next kernel.
#
# PCI_HYPERV_INTERFACE is likewise absent: PCI_HYPERV `select`s it, and a
# selected symbol follows its selector without being asked.
CONFIG_HYPERV=y
CONFIG_HYPERV_STORAGE=y
CONFIG_HYPERV_NET=y
CONFIG_HYPERV_UTILS=y
CONFIG_HYPERV_BALLOON=y
CONFIG_HYPERV_VSOCKETS=y
CONFIG_PCI_HYPERV=y
